OL,3,GNEWSABishop seeks to have child rape
OL,4,Acase dismissed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 70-year-old Roman Catholic bishop is
OL,7,Fseeking to have a court case in which
OL,8,Fhe is accused of two counts of raping a
OL,9,Fteenage girl dismissed.
OL,11,FDavid Oakley, the Bishop of
OL,12,FNorthampton, was charged in June
OL,13,Ffollowing an investigation by
OL,14,FStaffordshire Police.
OL,16,FHe is accused of kissing a teenage girl
OL,17,Fwhile on pilgrimage to Lourdes, France,
OL,18,Fand then having sex with her twice in
OL,19,Fthe UK when she was under the age of
OL,20,F16.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
