OL,3,GNEWSABishop seeks to have child rape
OL,4,Acase dismissed
OL,5,
OL,6,FOakley appeared at the Old Bailey, in
OL,7,FLondon, and spoke only to confirm his
OL,8,Fname and date of birth.
